  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 8001
    m_Localized: Green Slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8002
    m_Localized: A jelly-type monster commonly found in Evergreen Forest. Secretes
      toxic slime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8003
    m_Localized: Flame Slime
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8004
    m_Localized: A slime from the lava zone. Its body burns with intense heat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8005
    m_Localized: Forest Goblin
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8006
    m_Localized: A small humanoid monster that calls Evergreen Forest home. Wields
      a bone club.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8007
    m_Localized: Giant Mushroom Man
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8008
    m_Localized: A monster born from fungi deep in the forest. Releases spores to
      obscure vision.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8009
    m_Localized: "Forest Boss \u2014 Green Worm"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8010
    m_Localized: A giant worm monster living beneath Evergreen Forest. Burrows underground
      to ambush prey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8011
    m_Localized: Slime Jelly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8012
    m_Localized: Translucent jelly harvested from green slimes. Elastic and sweet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8013
    m_Localized: Flame Slime Core
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8014
    m_Localized: The core of a flame slime. When cooled
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8015
    m_Localized: Goblin Bone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8016
    m_Localized: Small dense bones from forest goblins. Used to make rich stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8017
    m_Localized: Goblin Meat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8018
    m_Localized: Flesh from forest goblins. Has a gamey smell and requires preparation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8019
    m_Localized: Mushroom Cap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8020
    m_Localized: The cap of a giant mushroom man. Rich in flavor and satisfyingly
      thick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8021
    m_Localized: Mushroom Spore
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8022
    m_Localized: Spores secreted by mushroom men. In small amounts they work as seasoning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8023
    m_Localized: Green Worm Meat
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8024
    m_Localized: Large cuts of meat from the green worm. Chewy and highly nutritious.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8025
    m_Localized: Green Worm Hide
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8026
    m_Localized: The thick outer skin of a green worm. Long boiling creates a rich
      broth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8027
    m_Localized: Slime Jelly Dessert
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8028
    m_Localized: A dessert made by setting sweet slime jelly. Has a restorative effect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8029
    m_Localized: Spicy Slime Stir-fry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8030
    m_Localized: A spicy stir-fry made from flame slime cores. Increases attack power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8031
    m_Localized: Goblin Bone Broth
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8032
    m_Localized: Rich stock simmered from goblin bones. Excellent for HP recovery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8033
    m_Localized: Grilled Mushroom Cap
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8034
    m_Localized: Thick slices of mushroom cap seared in a pan. Increases defense.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8035
    m_Localized: Green Worm Steak
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8036
    m_Localized: A premium steak cut thick from green worm meat. Raises all stats.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8037
    m_Localized: Slime Jelly Dessert Recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8038
    m_Localized: A basic dessert. Set 2 slime jellies in a mold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8039
    m_Localized: Spicy Slime Stir-fry Recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8040
    m_Localized: Stir-fry 1 flame slime core with 1 slime jelly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8041
    m_Localized: Goblin Bone Broth Recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8042
    m_Localized: Simmer 3 goblin bones for a long time to extract rich broth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8043
    m_Localized: Grilled Mushroom Cap Recipe
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8044
